<p style="margin:0 0 6px;font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:19px;font-weight:bold;color:#ffffff;">Sua senha foi alterada</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 20px;font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;color:#8a8a8a;line-height:1.6;">
  Olá, <strong style="color:#ffffff;font-weight:bold;"><%= @user.name %></strong>. A senha da sua conta foi alterada com sucesso.
</p>

<table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" role="presentation">
  <tr>
    <td style="background-color:#141414;border:1px solid #292929;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;">
      <p style="margin:0;font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px;color:#4d4d4d;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.5px;">Quando</p>
      <p style="margin:4px 0 0;font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-weight:bold;color:#ffffff;"><%= @changed_at %></p>
    </td>
  </tr>
</table>

<table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" role="presentation">
  <tr>
    <td align="center" style="padding:22px 0;">
      <a href="<%= @app_url %>/login" style="display:inline-block;background-color:#076fef;color:#ffffff;font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-weight:bold;text-decoration:none;padding:14px 34px;border-radius:10px;">
        Entrar no TrackRide
      </a>
    </td>
  </tr>
</table>

<table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" role="presentation">
  <tr>
    <td style="border-top:1px solid #292929;padding-top:18px;">
      <p style="margin:0;font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px;color:#8a8a8a;line-height:1.6;">
        <strong style="color:#ffffff;font-weight:bold;">Não foi você?</strong> Redefina a senha imediatamente em
        <a href="<%= @app_url %>/forgot-password" style="color:#076fef;text-decoration:none;font-weight:bold;">recuperar acesso</a>.
      </p>
    </td>
  </tr>
</table>
